     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>For tool manufacturers and Grinders, measurement data and data management are essential for achieving high cost-effectiveness and documented quality. ZOLLER provides everything you need to make this happen. </strong></p> <p>With ZOLLER, you have access to interfaces for CAD programs and CN controls, hardware and software for managing grinding wheels, process-integrated measuring and testing devices with micrometer-level accuracy for inspections, as well as reliable technologies for the error-free transfer of grinding wheel and geometry data to CNC grinding machines.</p>",
